    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="2" Size="12" Style="">Mae walks the fence line. The wheat is thin and going to seed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="2" Size="12" Style="">A CUSTODIAN from the county office waits by the gate, clipboard in hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
