    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="2" Size="12" Style="">They sent me to post the notice. I'm sorry about it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
